WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.490
Flip «l'envers» and you get «verlan».

2
00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.610
Flip «fou» and you get «ouf».

3
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.570
It's French made by swapping syllables.

4
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.190
Suppose that's what you chose to research.

5
00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.760
Now the questions arrive, in French:

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.020
«Pouvez-vous donner un exemple ?» Then:

7
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.200
«Vos sources sont-elles
fiables ?» How do you turn

8
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.320
a question you chose
yourself into a French talk

9
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.300
that makes you the expert in the room?

10
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.330
In this mission, you'll follow
the project journey in Mission D1,

11
00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:32.410
from the first idea to
the final discussion.

12
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.470
Then you'll hear a model
opening on «le verlan»,

13
00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.920
and meet the questions likely to come.

14
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.610
Your mission: find out how to become
the expert in the room, in French.
